---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BlogJsonLd from "../../components/BlogJsonLd.astro";
import TLDR from "../../components/ui/TLDR.astro";
import Chart from "../../components/Chart.astro";
const post = {
  slug: "agnes-ai-review-free-omni-modal-api-2026",
  title_en: "Agnes AI Review (2026): Free Text, Image & Video API",
  desc_en: "Agnes AI offers free API access to text, image, and video generation models. Is it worth using? We tested all three modes and here is our honest review.",
  date: "2026-07-14",
  read_time: "8 min read",
  author: "AI Tool Hub Editorial",
  tags: ["agnes-ai", "free-api", "ai-tools", "text-generation", "image-generation", "video-generation"]
};
const siteUrl = "https://thebestaitoolsreview.com";
---
<BaseLayout title={post.title_en} description={post.desc_en} keywords={post.tags.join(", ")}>
  <BlogJsonLd post={post} />
  <div class="article" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 0;">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/blog/">Blog</a> &rsaquo; <span>Agnes AI Review</span></nav>
    <header class="article-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Review</span>
      <h1>{post.title_en}</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-mute);font-size:14px;margin-top:4px;">{post.date} &middot; {post.read_time}</p>
    </header>
    <section class="article-body">
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--text-soft);line-height:1.7;">Agnes AI, created by Sapiens AI, is a free omni-modal AI platform that offers API access to text, image, and video generation models. In a market where most AI APIs charge per token, Agnes AI stands out by offering free API credits, free API keys, and access to state-of-the-art models. We tested all three modalities to see if the free tier is actually usable for real projects.</p>

      <img src="/images/blog/agnes-ai-review-free-omni-modal-api-2026/hero.jpg" alt="Agnes AI free API platform" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:24px 0;" loading="eager" />

      
      <TLDR items={[
        "Agnes AI Review (2026): Free Text, Image & Video API — key insights and takeaways",
        "Tested and reviewed by AI Tool Hub editorial team",
        "Updated July 2026 with latest information",
        "Free to read, no signup required"
      ]} />

      <h2>What is Agnes AI?</h2>
      <p>Agnes AI is a multi-modal AI platform developed by Sapiens AI, described as a "Global Top 10 AI Lab." The platform provides three categories of AI models:</p>
      <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
        <li><strong>Text Models:</strong> Agnes 2.0 Flash (available now) and Agnes 2.5 Flash (coming soon) for language generation, agent tasks, and tool orchestration</li>
        <li><strong>Image Models:</strong> Agnes Image 2.0 Flash and 2.1 Flash for AI image generation, with 2.5 Preview coming soon</li>
        <li><strong>Video Models:</strong> Agnes Video V2.0 for AI video generation, with 2.5 Preview in development</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Beyond raw models, Agnes AI also offers application products: <strong>Agnes</strong> (chat app), <strong>Agnes Code</strong> (coding assistant), <strong>Pavo</strong>, and <strong>Echo</strong>. The platform is open source on GitHub.</p>

      
      <Chart type="bar" title="Agnes AI Model Performance Scores" data={[
        {label: "Agnes 2.0 Flash (Text)", value: 60.9, unit: "%"},
        {label: "Claude Opus 4.6 (Text)", value: 70.8, unit: "%"},
        {label: "GPT 5.4 (Text)", value: 60.2, unit: "%"},
        {label: "Agnes Image 2.0", value: 1178, unit: " Elo"},
        {label: "GPT Image 2", value: 1250, unit: " Elo"},
        {label: "Agnes Video V2.0", value: 934, unit: " Elo"},
        {label: "Kling 3.0 Omni (Video)", value: 1066, unit: " Elo"}
      ]} />
<h2>Key Features</h2>

      <img src="/images/blog/agnes-ai-review-free-omni-modal-api-2026/inline-1.jpg" alt="Agnes AI text generation" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;" loading="lazy" />

      <h3>1. Free API Access</h3>
      <p>The standout feature of Agnes AI is its completely free API tier. Developers can:</p>
      <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
        <li>Create a free API key at the platform portal</li>
        <li>Get free API credits/tokens to start building</li>
        <li>Access text, image, and video generation through a single API</li>
        <li>Subscribe to a token plan for higher usage</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2. Text Generation (Agnes 2.0 Flash)</h3>
      <p>Agnes 2.0 Flash is optimized for fast, reliable, and cost-effective language generation. It supports agent task execution, tool orchestration, and image understanding. The model performs competitively on the ClawEval General Leaderboard, which measures multi-step reasoning capabilities across leading text models.</p>

      <img src="/images/blog/agnes-ai-review-free-omni-modal-api-2026/inline-2.jpg" alt="Agnes AI image generation" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;" loading="lazy" />

      <h3>3. Image Generation</h3>
      <p>Agnes Image 2.0 Flash and 2.1 Flash provide AI image generation capabilities. Based on our testing, the image generation quality is competitive with other free-tier image generators, making it a viable option for developers who need image generation without paying for Midjourney or DALL-E API access.</p>

      <h3>4. Video Generation</h3>
      <p>Agnes Video V2.0 is the video generation model. While still early in development, having video generation available as part of a free API platform is notable — most platforms charge premium rates for video generation.</p>

      <img src="/images/blog/agnes-ai-review-free-omni-modal-api-2026/inline-3.jpg" alt="Agnes AI developer platform" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0;" loading="lazy" />

      <h3>5. Agnes Code</h3>
      <p>Agnes Code is a coding assistant built on the Agnes AI platform. It leverages the text model for code generation, debugging, and development assistance. For developers looking for a free alternative to GitHub Copilot or Cursor, this is worth exploring.</p>

      <h3>6. Open Source</h3>
      <p>The Agnes AI project is open source on GitHub (AgnesAI-Labs/Agnes-AI), with an active Discord community and WeChat group. This is a significant advantage for developers who want to contribute, self-host, or build on the platform.</p>

      <h2>Pricing</h2>
      <p>Agnes AI is <strong>completely free</strong> for developers. You can create a free API key, get free tokens, and start building immediately. There is a token plan subscription for higher usage, but the free tier is generous enough for development and testing.</p>
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;">
        <thead><tr style="background:var(--card-bg);"><th style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);text-align:left;">Plan</th><th style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);text-align:left;">Price</th><th style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);text-align:left;">Features</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);">Free</td><td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);">$0</td><td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);">Free API key, free tokens, text + image + video</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);">Token Plan</td><td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);">Subscription</td><td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);">Higher token limits, priority access</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;">
        <div style="background:rgba(34,197,94,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.2);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;color:#22c55e;margin:0 0 8px;">Pros</h3>
          <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-soft);line-height:1.7;">
            <li>Completely free API access</li>
            <li>Text + image + video in one platform</li>
            <li>Open source on GitHub</li>
            <li>Agnes Code coding assistant</li>
            <li>Active community (Discord + WeChat)</li>
            <li>Competitive benchmark scores</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;color:#ef4444;margin:0 0 8px;">Cons</h3>
          <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-soft);line-height:1.7;">
            <li>Newer platform, ecosystem still growing</li>
            <li>Some models still in preview</li>
            <li>Documentation less comprehensive than OpenAI</li>
            <li>Video generation quality not yet top-tier</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Who Should Use Agnes AI?</h2>
      <p>Agnes AI is best for:</p>
      <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
        <li><strong>Developers</strong> who need free API access to AI models for prototyping</li>
        <li><strong>Students and hobbyists</strong> learning AI development without budget</li>
        <li><strong>Startups</strong> testing AI features before committing to paid APIs</li>
        <li><strong>Researchers</strong> who need multi-modal AI without institutional funding</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to Get Started</h2>
      <ol style="line-height:1.8;">
        <li>Visit <a href="https://agnes-ai.com" rel="nofollow">agnes-ai.com</a> and create a free account</li>
        <li>Go to the API Platform to get your free API key</li>
        <li>Read the developer docs for API usage examples</li>
        <li>Start with text generation (simplest), then try image and video</li>
        <li>Join the Discord community for support and updates</li>
      </ol>

      <img src="/images/blog/agnes-ai-review-free-omni-modal-api-2026/closing.jpg" alt="Future of free AI APIs" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:24px 0;" loading="lazy" />

      
      <Chart type="timeline" title="Agnes AI Development Timeline" data={[
        {date: "2026 Q1", title: "Platform Launch", description: "Agnes AI platform launched with free API access for developers."},
        {date: "2026 Q2", title: "Agnes 2.0 Flash", description: "Text model released with competitive benchmark scores on ClawEval."},
        {date: "2026 Q2", title: "Image 2.0 & 2.1 Flash", description: "Image generation models launched, competing with GPT Image and Flux."},
        {date: "2026 Q3", title: "Video V2.0", description: "Video generation model released with synchronized audio."},
        {date: "2026 Q4", title: "2.5 Models (Coming Soon)", description: "Next-generation models for text, image, and video in development."}
      ]} />
<h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:16px;">
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">Is Agnes AI really free?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-soft);margin:0;">Yes, Agnes AI offers free API access with free tokens. You can create a free API key and start using text, image, and video generation without paying. A paid token plan is available for higher usage.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">How does Agnes AI compare to OpenAI?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-soft);margin:0;">Agnes AI is free while OpenAI charges per token. Agnes AI offers omni-modal (text + image + video) in one platform. OpenAI has more mature documentation and a larger ecosystem. For prototyping and learning, Agnes AI is excellent; for production at scale, compare with OpenAI based on your needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">Is Agnes AI open source?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-soft);margin:0;">Yes, the Agnes AI project is open source on GitHub at AgnesAI-Labs/Agnes-AI. The community is active on Discord and WeChat.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:32px;padding:20px;background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:12px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">This Page Answers</h3>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-soft);line-height:1.8;">
          <li>What is Agnes AI and is it really free?</li>
          <li>How does Agnes AI compare to other AI APIs?</li>
          <li>What can you build with Agnes AI's free API?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px;">
        <a href="/tool/agnes-ai/" style="color:var(--accent-color);font-weight:600;">View Agnes AI Tool Page</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
        <a href="/alternatives/agnes-ai/" style="color:var(--accent-color);font-weight:600;">Agnes AI Alternatives</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
        <a href="/blog/" style="color:var(--accent-color);font-weight:600;">More Reviews</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
